WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.720
This isn't good.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.270
The way Madame Aoi acts toward Oga...

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.520
Chiaki, what do you think?

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.610
She's completely... head-over-heels.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.950
Losing her self-control like that...

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.200
You stupid, stupid, stupid-face!

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.700
Don't tell me she's forgotten our vow?

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.210
I feel a storm brewing.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.020
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.200
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.030
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.400
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
<b>Love is a Hurricane!</b>

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.010
You... You two-timing bastard!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.020
Huh?

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.740
Don't play dumb, you philanderer!

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:48.700
You've got Hilda-san, and at the same 
time you laid hands on the Queen!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.900
Idiot. Don't take me down to your level.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.550
Then what was that, huh?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.790
Didn't you see it? That Kuneida 
chick was seriously powerful!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.240
Baby Beel was even actually 
impressed for a change.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:07.350
I'm totally confident he'd 
fall in love with her!

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.900
I'm gonna shove this baby onto 
her if it's the last thing I do!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.600
Then I'll say, "See you later, 
alligator!" to this life I got now!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.900
That's some life-goal 
you got there... Sheesh.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.300
Who? What are you going 
to shove off, did you say?

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.100
You forgot his milk again.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.610
Madame Aoi!

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.510
W-What?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.560
Answer me straaaaaaaight out.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.730
What do you think of this Oga guy?

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:39.490
T-Think? Nothing much.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.700
You're lyin', ain't you?

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.390
Haven't you been totally off in 
another world since yesterday?

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:46.760
Please don't tell me...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.290
You've actually fallen for him, for real?!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.390
O-Of course not!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:56.470
Well, I mean... When he said that 
to me, I was really surprised...

00:03:56.470 --> 00:04:00.020
And I don't actually think 
he's all that bad a guy...

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.000
And that baby is kinda cute, you know?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.220
Put a fork in 'er. She's done.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.350
B-B-B-But I can't just 
become a mother, right?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.310
I'm still in high school. There's 
a proper order to these things.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:19.600
Madame, don't tell me you 
forgot our vow, right?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.310
Acquire no man!

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.270
Passed down for two generations, 
the tradition of the Red Tails...

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.870
When you get a boyfriend, you quit!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:34.960
That is the one-and-only rule 
which has kept the team together.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.100
You won't be able to give orders 
to the lower-ranks like this.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.510
That's why I told you...

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.840
It's not like that.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.140
I can believe you, right?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:50.820
Yes.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.680
I see... A woman, is it?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:59.350
It is true that the master will take to 
anyone who is strong, be they man or woman.

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:00.210
Yup!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.640
I am surprised there was a human of 
such caliber still in this school.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.420
I'd like to meet her once.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.950
Now, now, Master... You're spilling it.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.730
Aww... I want to be pampered, too!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.190
Who was that?! Don't break my mood!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.580
I spot me an Oga-Wife!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.130
Sure you wanna have happy family 
time in a place like this?

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.310
You've let your guard down too much, Oga.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.430
<b>Ikari</b>

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.040
M... MK-5!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.630
They're so cruel, no one 
will even get near them!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:41.720
They're the guys you don't wanna get anywhere 
near! The group of five Major Mood-Killers, MK-5!

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.750
Ishiyama ain't all about the TKKH, you know.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.290
If you value the life of your wife and kid...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.830
It's you who should value your life...

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:55.660
Tell me your name!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:57.460
Ikari...

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.710
Chato!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:05:59.410
Shimamura!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.450
Nakata!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.340
Bu!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.900
I-Instant defeat!

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.790
And what kind of a character 
introduction was <i>that</i>?

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.920
Whoa, Oga's wife don't hold back!

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:09.810
Y-You've got to be kiddin' me!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.030
Get with the mood!

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.480
Ain't happening!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.450
The two of them seem more and more in sync.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.940
Looks like Oga did in the MK-5!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.140
Seriously? Those guys 
should've read the mood!

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.700
Oga again?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.690
What a little troublemaker he is!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.650
Madame Aoi!

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:38.310
Cute...

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.380
W-Who is that woman?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.100
The woman took out most of 'em, right?

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.950
Yeah... They're one seriously 
strong husband and wife team.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.290
Husband and wife?!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.210
What do you mean by husband and wife?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:02.460
I mean, that blond girly is Oga's wife.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.770
Nice, huh?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:04.660
...wait!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.800
It's Kunieda!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.290
So that's how it is...

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.790
Not once, but twice?

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.460
Looks like we've got to do something.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.600
So, Oga?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.970
How exactly are you going to shove 
Baby Beel off onto the Queen?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.550
It's true that Kunieda is 
strong, but she isn't evil.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.060
Did you think Baby Beel would just 
take a liking to her on his own?

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:45.750
Furuichi.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.470
Men are all about guts!

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:50.500
So basically you have no plan?

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.500
Idiot! She's the Queen! The Queen!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.850
A Demon Lord is sure to 
fall for her, you betcha!

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.050
It's a nickname, you know!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.540
Oga-chan!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.840
I hear you went a round with Kunieda?

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:04.770
Over so fast?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.020
I wished I could have watched...

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:07.580
Whozat?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.040
You know, the guy that was with Kanzaki.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.600
But you didn't actually 
decide the winner, right?

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.750
She's pretty strong, yeah...

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.250
Oga Tatsumi!

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:22.650
You're coming with us.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.970
Hilda-san! Their leader just 
said something about...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:30.900
Huh?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:32.620
I see.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:44.700
You are Kunieda, yes? 
I could tell just at a glance.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.380
S-She could tell?

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.550
Don't tell me his wife knows about that!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.560
You definitely sound like you could do it.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.190
No! Not at all!

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:00.290
I mean, it wasn't like I was trying to...

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.430
Shall we dispense with 
the long-winded speeches?

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.840
Let us get on with this, already.

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:11.200
It doesn't seem like talking's 
going to accomplish anything.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.060
From above!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.510
You have excellent reaction time.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.050
Shingetsu sword school, third style!

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.390
Interesting!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.720
You should feel honored 
to have forced me to draw!

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:00.630
She just barely dodged, from that position?

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.240
She is strong.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:06.940
But unfortunately, not at his level.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:09.800
Madame Aoi!

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:14.170
Nana-san and Chiaki-san have been...

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:22.070
They've been treated just now.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:27.940
Who did this?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.650
Nene-san said she and Chiaki-san 
were gonna talk with Oga.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:39.570
Hey, you hear? Oga half-killed 
two of Kunieda's girls!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.640
You kiddin' me?

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.670
He don't hold back, even 'gainst girls!

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:47.870
Kunieda's seriously pissed! 
They're facing off on the roof!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.460
Oga Tatsumi...

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.250
I won't forgive you.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.530
They say Oga and Kunieda's 
facin' off on the roof!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:24.770
I totally wanna watch, but the thunder's 
so scary, I can't go outside!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.850
Hey, you came to me? Better 
than I could ask for.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.520
So? What won't you forgive me for?

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.130
You're aiming for me, right?

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:51.730
Then come to <i>me</i> first!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.150
Aiming?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:11:59.780
Oh, you knew?

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.930
Then that simplifies things.

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:12.780
Here. Anytime you're ready.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.660
At a time like this, you 
still hide behind your baby?

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:18.840
You fiend!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:24.520
What? You won't take him for free?

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:26.750
What did you do?

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.500
What did you do to them?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.120
For them to be so beat up...

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:32.400
Those two...?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.710
I don't got any use for weaklings, see.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.100
I just blew them away real quick like.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.290
You villain!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.950
Nene-san, you're awake?

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.070
I...

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.970
Baby Beel!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.670
Let go, you wicked cat!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.250
Uh... Can we fight or something?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.750
It's not the time for that!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.160
Don't cry, Baby Beel! It's only a light cut!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.950
Hey! Wait!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.440
Don't cry, Baby Beel!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.670
What, not gonna?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.500
What was with him?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.500
The cat was cute.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.120
Man... Looks like he gave us the slip.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.780
But... He really didn't look like a bad guy.

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:01.320
Chiaki, you too?

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:04.400
That's right. Oga is the pinnacle of evil!

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.130
Madame Aoi!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:13.800
Don't worry! She said she was 
going to get revenge for you!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:14.740
On the roof against Oga!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.790
This is bad... If the two of them fight now,

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.290
it'll go exactly as they planned it to!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.290
MK-5!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.440
Dead end.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.470
You guys really do kill the mood.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.910
Oga and Kunieda are facing off?

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.200
Seriously?!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.700
Yup, sounds like it.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.850
I heard Oga beat some of 
Kunieda's girls to a pulp!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.780
Kunieda ain't gonna stand for that, no way.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.830
Beat up?

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.000
Crush each other, do it!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.690
And then we'll finish off 
whichever one's left!

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.000
It's going great, isn't it, Miwa-san?

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:11.570
Who'd have thought it? Rough her girls up 
a bit, and she plays right into our hands.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:18.700
I can tell precisely what 
that woman is thinking.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.880
Kunieda Aoi...

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.740
Suffering from having to 
fight the one she loves...

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.820
Savor it.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:32.550
You're really perceptive noticing Queen 
Kunieda fell for Oga like that...

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.370
Who did you just call "Queen"?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.410
I said: Who did you just call "Queen"?

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.420
Killing the mood as always, damn you!

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:45.740
I apologize Miwa-san, sir!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:46.920
That's right.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.550
There's no need for two Queens.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:56.090
I see. Miwa's the asshole who did this!

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:59.800
Bingo.

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:04.040
I ain't gonna let you guys do...

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:04.850
Hold it!

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.750
You aren't escaping.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.390
Why? Why won't you attack?

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.540
I don't know what you're thinking,

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.790
but you haven't suffered 
near the pain those two did!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.590
Shingetsu sword school, first style!

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:31.670
Rock Shatter!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:32.840
Chrysanthemum Cut!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.030
Madame Aoi!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.750
Sounds like it's over.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.720
Time to finish up here too!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.080
I'm sorry, Madame Aoi...

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.900
I was always acting without your orders...

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.660
I figured as much.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.770
Go. I'll be up shortly.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.870
What the hell are you doing?

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:08.770
Well, you see... You guys aren't fun at all.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:21.880
Madame Aoi!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.600
You're mistaken! It wasn't Oga!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.810
This was a trap!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.090
The one who beat up Chiaki and me was...

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.700
Checkmate!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.050
Miwa!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.360
What is going on?

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.080
It was all a trap to make you 
and Oga fight each other.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.890
And thanks to that, you're barely 
standing... That's dangerous, you know.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.500
Could you beat me like you are now, I wonder?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.650
Do you have any idea how hard it 
was to sit back and take all that?!

00:17:58.190 --> 00:17:59.650
Get the hell outta my way.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.840
Ah, that hit the spot.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.860
Now then... How are Oga-chan 
and the others doing?

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:15.000
What have you...

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.950
...done to me, you jackass!

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.080
And what the hell? Seriously?!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.500
Weren't you all beat up like a second ago?

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.470
Get with the mood already, jeez!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.170
We were about to have a battle 
to decide who's Queen!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.020
Don't you see how these things go?!

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.500
Damn it all! I can't believe you!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:35.690
How dare you do this to my beautiful face!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.270
I am so going to...

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.990
Say what?

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.450
Hey! What have you done to my girlish face?!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.000
Come on, people are still...

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.560
Shut up!

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.130
Finally, peace and quiet.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.380
Oh? Feeling better yourself, Baby Beel?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:07.160
Good. I spilled a little blood 
for you, so no more crying, 'kay?

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:11.920
Now then... Let's continue where we left off.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.170
I've lost.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.900
Or, well... That's not right.

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:23.240
I apologize.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:25.950
What should I say?

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.470
Oh? Then, here.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:37.500
If I withstood your attacks, 
you'd agree to take him, right?

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.400
Where'd that rule come from?

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.590
Man, that was pretty tough.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:53.860
I wasn't able to jump in 
before, but this is dangerous!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.050
Their misunderstanding is cleared 
up, and they're making up!

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.710
The two of them'll get really close!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.920
Crap! Why is it always 
Oga who gets the chicks?!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:03.890
Indeed.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.840
I'm highly disappointed in that man.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.930
And I had thought his ruthlessness 
was his one redeeming value.

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.900
So he won't fight a woman, will he?

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.710
Worthless piece of trash.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.870
Um... Were you behind me the whole time?

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.060
Yes.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:24.360
Your hushed whispers of "Yes, that's 
it! Do him harder!" stirred my heart.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.910
Please don't!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.100
And that's that. Hope you enjoy him.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.650
W-Wait a second!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:37.040
Take him? But he's yours, right?

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.020
He's not my kid, duh!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.580
I've just been forced to 
raise him, that's all.

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:47.470
Then the blond woman... She's not your wife?

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:48.650
Not even close.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.260
Then who the hell is she?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.090
How should I put this...

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:53.830
She's a total demon.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.080
A demon!?

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.100
...a devil woman!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:00.800
How much longer are you going 
to waste spouting nonsense?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:01.720
We're going home.

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:04.080
That woman will not become the parent.

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:05.370
But...

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:08.460
Now, Master, let's go home.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.200
Hey! Hold it!

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:12.260
Wait!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.900
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.340
Forcing another person 
to care for your child...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.540
If you have a problem with it, train 
yourself and come at me again.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.320
So in the end, this time was no use either.

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:35.250
Don't worry, Furuichi. I'm not giving up.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.820
Wait a moment, Madame 
Aoi! What are you saying?

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:43.440
Isn't it obvious? My head wasn't on straight 
and I ended up causing everyone trouble.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.150
But, you don't have to quit...

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.910
Come on, Chiaki, say something!

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:49.960
I like your new look!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:50.860
Chiaki!

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:54.010
And besides, I've been thinking 
about it for a while.

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:57.530
It was about time to leave 
the Red Tails to you, Nene.

00:21:57.530 --> 00:21:58.360
Madame Aoi!

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:01.900
So don't be getting any strange thoughts!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:04.850
Next time we settle this!

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:12.580
Madame Aoi!

00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:45.690
Every night, when the clock strikes 8,

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:47.450
It's 8 o'clock!

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:48.760
MK-5.

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:50.070
It ain't 8 yet!

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:03.900
Well then, what is on next week's Beelzebub?

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:06.260
Hello, I am Oga Tatsumi's father.

00:24:06.850 --> 00:24:09.220
It's my first preview, so 
I'm a little nervous...

00:24:09.780 --> 00:24:13.050
Ah yes, I suppose I don't have a name yet.

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:17.010
Even Furuichi's little sister, 
Honoka, has a name...

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:18.480
Oh right, next week's Beelzebub:

00:24:18.860 --> 00:24:22.560
Baby Beel's Assessment Test, and 
Hilda: Dear Great Demon Lord.

00:24:22.560 --> 00:24:24.020
It's a two parter.

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:26.020
Please watch next week as well.

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.270
That's all, folks.

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:28.320
Stop right there!
